{"about_the_game":"[/url]\n\nPRO\u0106EMON is a retro-style procedurally generated monster collecting game. Everything is a glitch, all the time.\n\n[img width=\"600\" height=\"60\"][/img]\n\nEvery monster is procedurally generated and totally unique. All sprites, stats, flavor text, and attack moves are totally random.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid]\n\nFuse two Pro\u0107emon to make a new powerful Pro\u0107emon!\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid]\n\n[img width=\"600\" height=\"60\"][/img]\n\nUse the [b]Procedural Generator[/b] to journey to new worlds.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" mp4=\"\" webm=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b]Battle enemies[/b] to level up your Pro\u0107emon or [b]charm enemies[/b] into joining your team. Every move, animation, sound, and special effect is procedurally generated.\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid]\n\nEarn [b]badges [/b] by defeating the [b]Shareholders[/b] of the evil [b]Infinity Corporation[/b].\n\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"432\"][/imgvid<br><br>PRO\u0106EMON is a retro-style procedurally generated monster collecting game. Everything is a glitch, all the time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/4ac364ae45138976a1c0f75ab0053737.webp?t=1677880705\" width=600 height=60 /></span><br><br>Every monster is procedurally generated and totally unique. All sprites, stats, flavor text, and attack moves are totally random.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058380/extras/315cd335923fde55338f80d3125aac5b.poster.avif?t=1677880705\" width=480 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat